<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States has imposed sanctions on Rwanda’s defence ministry for supplying the M23 rebels and for operating a gold-smuggling route that passes through Uganda to fund an Islamic State-linked insurgency in eastern DRC. Ebola cases in the Democratic Republic of the Congo have risen above 10,000, and a nurse treating patients was killed by a mob while another health worker was wounded. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/30/europe-today-rare-oleshky-truce-holds-in-ukraine-albania-imposes-heavy-fines-on-protesters&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/29/world/africa/rwanda-sanctions-m23-congo.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNZnU0aGFMeWRjQTBfUHd2ODRWazRkdlZva29rNDdESnZiVldzV2MzUlNWbmthOGtEcGZyZHZCc2RTMmZ2T2kweDF4TkQxRTQ5Z1NEUG04eWExUHpwQ0JEaTVPQWwtQjB0VWZqMG9Pd3BEdDZTSGZYMVU1U0YtV0gwVXR6YXlUZzhfQkEzZjVLZTV5b2tLOUEwS2JWY05rZUZ4Z2tQNzgyQkxMVzhSS012Mkp4ZkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPOFYtRjZlV2pJVEt3WXZLMzhFa3R4NVhNTUFLY0c4ZzU2bUJLTTBjd2w3Ykx4ajctNnl4ZGIydFBIeV9aQXVLMjktcGZEMTNFbXhBY0tLMW53cFhjWUhYRExBX2NRa2U4OGhra2FCZlk0QTdvdnZUTjBkVzU3clVleDRFaWFvVDF0amhlTzF2U1o?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBfb2tENi0ybW1icG5yNEJnVUtfRVItTUZ3VzItOXBQSXBMekVrMjFaYmlVRUhNM1lEWWt1U3FRZUdKWjJNTlJSMHd4QjRSdWdadklDcVR1Qk5ON3p5enfSAWNBVV95cUxQem8zMFBuVVdCV3EtMDdMekhmQUI5YzRJZlFHQmRxc3JvTkhwaml4ZUtQSEtPVVhEeVRfeUZFeUlUc3ppV1BTSmZtdHNtX2p5U3BRS05jVXQ2aGFpTEJXWGVYQVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNRDZzOUVtM2NMaExvWjV0aVN